# Testing & Quality Rules

## Tests
- Add tests for behavior changes and bug fixes.
- Prefer stable tests: avoid brittle assertions and over-mocking.
- Use the existing testing stack (JUnit/Mockito/Spring Test) already present.

## What to test
- Domain logic: unit tests.
- Integration boundaries: integration tests where valuable (repository/service integration).
- Edge cases: nulls, empty lists, unexpected inputs, boundary values.

## PR Checklist
- Code compiles
- Tests pass
- No unnecessary file changes
- No new dependencies
- No contract breaks (unless requested)
